## Phase-4 root corrections

- `AuthorityChainUpdateError` is a closed `Cancelled | Integrity` result for
  the sole ordered reorg consumer. Allocation retains and retries the exact
  request/command internally; effect lifecycle closure while the producer is
  live is a topology integrity fault. A future broad service error cannot
  silently terminate the reorg task.
- Resolve/Verify per-owner fairness and strict Ready priority are distinct
  documented policies. Ready is `Recovery > Proposal > Remote`, fee rate,
